      "## Small and explicit\n\nGo is a compiled, statically typed language with a small feature set. Functions can return multiple values, and errors are **ordinary values**: functions return an `error` that callers check explicitly rather than using exceptions. Interfaces are satisfied implicitly: a type implements an interface just by having its methods.",
